Changelog – Create: Better Motors (v3.0.2 for MC 1.20.1)
Bug Fixes:

- Fixed Nitro Motor behavior at default config values causing it to rotate intermittently due to FE and stress dropping to 0 mid-cycle.

- Resolved missing recipe for Reggarfonite Block now properly craftable instead of only obtainable via blasting.

- Added missing name localization for Raw Reggarfonite Block and made it crushable, consistent with other raw ore blocks.

- Restored Heavy Connector energy functionality (backported fix from 3.1.2).

- Fixed Reggarfonite Ore spawning above deepslate level – now properly spawns in deepslate layers only. Also added a config option to disable Reggarfonite worldgen.

- Enabled washing of Crushed Raw Reggarfonite with a 10% chance to drop Prismarine Shards and Prismarine Crystals.

Added missing Forge tags:

- forge:ingots/reggarfonite

- forge:nuggets/reggarfonite

Improvements:

- Added config option to enable or disable the first join message for players.


